  "question": {
    "text": "If $y=3 x+6 x^{2}+10 x^{3}+\\ldots \\ldots \\ldots, \\infty,$ then\r\n\r\n$\\frac{1}{3} y-\\frac{1.4}{3^{2} 2} y^{2}+\\frac{1.4 .7}{3^{2} 3} y^{3}-\\ldots \\ldots \\infty$ is equal to",
